WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.490
A laminated card beside a supermarket register sets out a loyalty program's terms.

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:10.510
Clause one point two fixes what will count as a cybernetic device.

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:16.890
Sunniva Balogun's doctoral thesis counted every definition of the word she could find.

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:21.440
I walked thirty-one trading sites over nineteen weeks,

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:25.810
reading every surface a customer may read without asking.

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:28.940
She found two hundred and ten definitions:

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:30.620
seventy-one in the literature,

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.720
and a hundred and thirty-nine in shops.

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:36.680
Each one was scored out of ten on her Cyberneticity Index.

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:38.620
It reads eight facets,

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:42.700
such as whether a definition names a loop, a goal, or what it leaves out.

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:46.779
I set the line at six point two five,

00:00:46.979 --> 00:00:49.569
the median of the published definitions.

00:00:49.869 --> 00:00:54.989
A definition at or above it is classified deeply cybernetic.

00:00:55.789 --> 00:00:58.559
A hundred and seventeen definitions cleared the line,

00:00:58.759 --> 00:01:00.529
seventy-nine of them from shops.

00:01:00.829 --> 00:01:03.449
Nine point one seven, the highest score of all,

00:01:03.549 --> 00:01:05.189
went to the card at the register.

00:01:05.989 --> 00:01:10.729
The statement that named the field in nineteen forty-eight falls just short, at five point eight three.

00:01:11.029 --> 00:01:15.139
Its fuller form, from nineteen sixty-one, lands exactly on the line.

00:01:15.939 --> 00:01:17.589
The University has adopted the line.

00:01:17.789 --> 00:01:21.809
The word cybernetic may now enter a University name only where its definition clears it,

00:01:22.009 --> 00:01:25.079
with no waiver, and no exemption for existing use.

00:01:26.279 --> 00:01:30.969
The card is at the register because the register is where the term is applied.
